flowchart TD
  U[Utilisateur] --> APP[App iPhone Expo]
  APP --> SQLITE[(SQLite local replica)]
  APP --> BRIDGE[Native Capability Bridge]
  APP --> API[Ubuntu API Gateway]
  API --> ORCH[Orchestrator LLM]
  ORCH --> STATE[State Service]
  ORCH --> MEMORY[Memory Service]
  ORCH --> GATE[Permission Gateway]
  ORCH --> BUS[Message Board]
  BUS --> WORKERS[Remote/Local Workers]
  WORKERS --> GATE
  GATE --> EXEC[Sandbox Executors]
  STATE --> DB[(SQLite/Postgres)]
  MEMORY --> VEC[(FAISS/Qdrant)]
  GATE --> AUDIT[Audit Ledger]
  WORKERS --> FEEDBACK[Feedback Service]
  BRIDGE <--> PHONEBROKER[Phone Capability Broker]
  PHONEBROKER <--> BUS
